{
  "bookId": "hero-214202",
  "id": "bond-26002",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26002001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "这是何意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "给你的，房子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你不是说，变成手办后，每天晚上你都不用睡觉吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "为了帮你消磨时间，就准备了这屋子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这里还有许多藏书，我托人制成了适合手办的大小。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "有这些陪伴，应当可以替你排解不少寂寞。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "哼，无聊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "有时间准备这些，你不如多看几本书。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "为你准备的这些书，也是我之后准备学习的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你往后可以用这些来考较我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "……看来你还算有些长进。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "这东西，我姑且收下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "昨天的课程你都记得怎样了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我昨天给你准备这房子去了，没学也是理所当然的事情吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26002015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
